        "description": "When was the last time you took a leap of faith?\n\nThis mixed reality game strips everything back to basics — no frills, no distractions. Just you, your courage, and the thrill of the jump. Whether you're playing on your stove, ceiling, window, or door, all you need is one hand or one controller to leap forward.\n\nAnd when you fail? Get back up and leap again. \n\n- Enjoy WeChat Tiao Yi Tiao (跳一跳) mobile game? You’ll enjoy this\n- Never ending MR hyper-casual game\n- Juicy translucent jelly art style\n- Randomly generated gummy characters and colors\n- Simple hand gesture or controller interaction\n- Challenge friends to get highest score on a leaderboard\n- Move and place on any surface in your space\n- Relatable life quotes",
